// AWS GuardDuty Findings Suppressed  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1562.008
// Detects creation of GuardDuty suppression filters or trusted-IP sets, or archiving findings (CreateFilter, CreateIPSet,…
// False positives: Legitimate tuning of GuardDuty noise (review the filter/IP set contents).
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/guardduty-suppress-findings.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreateFilter$/i or eventName=/^UpdateFilter$/i or eventName=/^CreateIPSet$/i or eventName=/^UpdateFindingsFeedback$/i eventSource=/^guardduty\.amazonaws\.com$/i
